flowchart TB
 P["01 YOU TYPE YOUR NORMAL CLAUDE PROMPT<br/>No special ceremony • task can be life, science, business or code"] --> HEAD["UBERMIND OMEGA 11 / FIVE-HOUR MINIMIZER<br/>One accountable Claude Pro lead session • no background swarm"]
 STAR["WESSAM SINGULARITY -> SOVEREIGN CONTINUUM<br/>PERSONAL CIVILIZATION -> UBERBOND -> UBERMIND"] -. "Life-level goals + permissions" .-> HEAD
 HEAD --> ACCEPT["02 FIDELITY ESCROW<br/>Outcome contract • original prompt/hash<br/>Required quality • source version • forbidden effects"]
 MEMORY["890 ORIGINAL FOUNDER IDEAS / TEN SOURCE SHARDS<br/>GENESIS descendants • Total Brain • PHOENIX<br/>Negative Knowledge • Capability Genome"] -. "W30 HOT18 + minimum relevant source pointers" .-> ACCEPT
 ACCEPT --> BUDGET["03 FIVE-HOUR METER GOVERNOR<br/>Subscription allowance ≠ API dollars<br/>Plan for least total inference, including coordination"]
 BUDGET --> EXACT{"04 EXACT PROOF STILL VALID?<br/>E0–E4 code / certified cache / already accepted subtask"}
 EXACT -- YES --> FREE["EXECUTE VERIFIED SCRIPT / DB / TEST<br/>No EXTRA generative inference for that subtask"]
 EXACT -- NO --> REUSE["05 DECISION-DAG DIFFERENCE ENGINE<br/>Reuse unchanged subexpressions<br/>Cognitive multicast and Crown coalescing"]
 REUSE --> JEVQ{"06 TYPED NOUL / CHOICE / SCORE needed?"}
 JEVQ -- "Separately authorized and funded" --> JEV["JEV 1.13 GOVERNED HYPERREFLEX<br/>W11–W22 tensor, exact public reuse, single-flight,<br/>fresh-spend reservation, source gate, unknown=HOLD"]
 JEVQ -- "Strict $20 Pro / no authorized JEV" --> LOCAL["DETERMINISTIC UBERMIND RULE CODE<br/>No separate paid inference"]
 JEV --> TYPED{"Bounded typed proof sufficient?"}
 TYPED -- YES --> FREE
 TYPED -- NO --> PRESSURE
 LOCAL --> PRESSURE{"07 QUALITY PRESSURE VALVE<br/>Does this semantic delta need the Frontier Crown?"}
 PRESSURE -- "Routine, established contract" --> SONNET["SONNET 5.5 MAIN • SOLO FIRST<br/>Implement / synthesize / run deterministic tests"]
 PRESSURE -- "Large bounded read-only source discovery" --> HAIKU["HAIKU 5.5 CUSTOM SCOUT<br/>Max 6 turns • Read/Grep/Glob • source pointers"]
 PRESSURE -- "Novel, critical, irreducibly hard" --> OPUS["OPUS 5.5 HIGH • FRONTIER CROWN<br/>One deep spec / falsification, not constant polling"]
 HAIKU --> CONTRACT["08 SPEC-TO-CODE COMPILER<br/>Typed task DAG • owned paths • source SHA<br/>quality tests • precise unknowns"]
 OPUS --> CONTRACT
 CONTRACT --> PARALLEL{"09 DOES EXTRA PARALLELISM BEAT SOLO USAGE<br/>AT SAME ACCEPTED QUALITY?"}
 PARALLEL -- "NO / NO EVIDENCE / DEFAULT" --> SONNET
 PARALLEL -- "YES: genuine independent modules" --> TEAM["BOUNDED P2P AGENT TEAM<br/>Sonnet builder + Sonnet independent tester<br/>Haiku scout only when net positive"]
 TEAM --> PACKET["SOURCE-BOUND PEER RECEIPTS<br/>Deltas, failures, contradiction, test evidence<br/>No whole-transcript broadcasts"]
 SONNET --> PACKET
 PACKET --> HARD{"10 HIGH-END SEMANTIC FAILURE REMAINS?"}
 HARD -- NO --> COURT
 HARD -- YES --> CROWN["FRONTIER DELTA REVIEW ONLY<br/>Opus on Pro if available; separate external<br/>Sol/Astra/candidates LOCKED without authority"]
 CROWN --> MULTI{"Independent hypotheses clearly improve quality?"}
 MULTI -- NO --> COURT
 MULTI -- YES --> EXPLORE["Adaptive N2 -> N4 -> N8 ONLY ON MERIT<br/>No blind always-on team; check remaining usage"]
 EXPLORE --> COURT["11 REALITY COURT<br/>Source proof • hostile tests • acceptance<br/>No cheaper failure qualifies as savings"]
 FREE --> COURT
 COURT --> PASS{"QUALITY ACHIEVED + PERMISSIONS VALID?"}
 PASS -- NO --> REPAIR["Targeted repair or Opus escalation<br/>If quota exhausted: PHOENIX checkpoint + legitimate reset"]
 PASS -- YES --> FINISH["12 ACCEPTED ARTIFACT / GOVERNED PR / LIVE RECEIPT"]
 FINISH --> PHOENIX["13 COGNITIVE COMPOUND-INTEREST FACTORY<br/>Proof #57 / Error #58 / Prediction #59<br/>Civilization Git #61 / Self-Falsify #653<br/>Capability Genome + GENESIS lineage"]
 PHOENIX -. "Certify exact next-time reuse" .-> EXACT
 PHOENIX -. "Update negative knowledge / original pointers" .-> MEMORY
 FINISH --> MEASURE["14 FIVE-HOUR SAME-TASK QUALITY BENCHMARK<br/>Baseline 100% -> observed candidate ?%<br/>W33 user-attested paired session windows<br/>Same task, grade, and whole-agent usage"]
 MEASURE --> TARGET{"Observed same-quality usage reduced?"}
 TARGET -- YES --> LEARN["Promote only measured task-class policy<br/>Keep source receipts and rollback"]
 TARGET -- NO / UNKNOWN --> RETAIN["No victory claim; revert to safe model path"]
 LEARN -. "Task-class allocation learning" .-> PRESSURE
 BUDGET_INFO["STRICT CLAUDE PRO $20<br/>NO paid JEV / Fable / API fallback<br/>Shared five-hour and weekly allowance"] -. "Hard resource constraint" .-> BUDGET
 THEORY["W33 GOAL: 100% -> 30% FIVE-HOUR USAGE<br/>70% reduction / 3.33x conditional capacity<br/>Not an actual observed result or quota change"] -. "Measure instead of imagine" .-> MEASURE
